<title>BELGIUM: EU cereal experts to vote on worked oats.</title>
<headline>EU cereal experts to vote on worked oats.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee will vote on Thursday on a regulation allowing 10,000 tonnes of Canadian worked oats to be imported at a reduced tariff, an EU offcial said.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be a vote on the reduced tariff quota of worked oats from Canada under the GATT (General Agreement on Tariffs and Trade) agreement covering enlargement of the Community,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
